# Profile: all-on - CI and layout-budget runs only; never deployed.
# Generated by npm run flags:docs from src/lib/flags/profiles.ts. Do not edit by hand: change the profile and regenerate.
# Names and safe values only. A flag is on only for the exact value 1. NEXT_PUBLIC_* names are set at BUILD time (a change needs a rebuild).
# Every feature flag on, with consent enforcement. Off on purpose: demo mode, the closed-loop fake destination, sample partner data, SSO_ONLY and the blocked Autopilot apply switch. Outbound flags are on only because CI injects fakes and holds no keys and no network; it is validated with assumeCredentials and never deployed.

